# Post-Fix Regression Testing Rule

## Overview
After making any code changes to the TestifiAI codebase, you MUST run regression tests before considering the task complete.

## Trigger Conditions
This rule applies when you modify files in:
- `backend/src/**` (Backend code)
- `loveable/src/**` (Frontend code)
- `prisma/schema.prisma` (Database schema)
- `scripts/**` (Build or test scripts)

## Environment URLs

### Staging Environment
- **Frontend**: https://staging.app.testifi.ai
- **Backend API**: https://testifi-backend-staging-748916208557.us-central1.run.app

### Production Environment
- **Frontend**: https://app.testifi.ai
- **Backend API**: https://testifi-backend-748916208557.us-central1.run.app

## Required Steps After Code Changes

### 1. Deploy the Changes
If backend code was modified:
```bash
# Build and deploy backend to staging
gcloud builds submit --config=backend/backend-build-cloudrun.yaml --project=golden-cosmos-450417-i8
gcloud run deploy testifi-backend-staging --image=us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/golden-cosmos-450417-i8/testifi-repo/testifi-backend:latest --region=us-central1 --project=golden-cosmos-450417-i8
```

If frontend code was modified:
```bash
# Build and deploy frontend to staging
gcloud builds submit --config=loveable/frontend-cloudbuild-cloudrun.yaml --project=golden-cosmos-450417-i8 --substitutions=_VITE_API_URL=https://testifi-backend-staging-748916208557.us-central1.run.app,_VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_XXXXX
gcloud run deploy testifi-frontend-staging --image=us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/golden-cosmos-450417-i8/testifi-repo/testifi-frontend:latest --region=us-central1 --project=golden-cosmos-450417-i8
```

### 2. Run Regression Tests on Staging
```bash
npm run test:regression:staging
```

### 3. Review Results
Check the test results in `test-results/` directory:
- `api-results-*.csv` - API endpoint test results
- `regression-summary-*.csv` - Overall summary
- `playwright-results/` - Frontend E2E test results

### 4. If Tests Pass
- Consider the fix verified on staging
- Proceed with production deployment if approved
- Run `npm run test:regression:prod` after production deployment

### 5. If Tests Fail
- Analyze the failures
- Fix any regressions introduced by your changes
- Re-run the test suite until passing

## Test Commands Reference

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm run test:regression` | Run full suite against local |
| `npm run test:regression:staging` | Run full suite against staging |
| `npm run test:regression:prod` | Run full suite against production |
| `npm run test:api:staging` | Run only API tests against staging |
| `npm run test:frontend` | Run only Playwright frontend tests |

## Expected Pass Rates
- API Tests: >= 90% pass rate expected
- Frontend E2E Tests: >= 95% pass rate expected

## Test Credentials
- E2E test user: `testifi.e2e.test@gmail.com` / `TestifiE2E2026!`
- Admin credentials: See `test-admin-login.json`

## Do NOT Skip This Step
Regression testing is mandatory. Do not mark a task as complete until:
1. Code changes are deployed to staging
2. Regression tests have been run
3. Results have been reviewed
4. Any failures have been addressed
